# Build-time client configuration - BAKED into the compiled DLL as constants by
# bake_env.py (see the GenerateBuildConfig target in the csproj). This file is
# never shipped; the client reads no files at runtime (settings dialog PlayerPrefs
# override > baked default, nothing else).
#
# MAIN_SERVER_SOURCE is the single source of truth for the official instance:
#   scheme https -> port 443, http -> port 80, explicit :port wins over both.
#   The SAME port number carries the REST api (TCP, /api/v1/**) and the LiteNetLib
#   game traffic (UDP). Forks point this at their own instance and rebuild.
MAIN_SERVER_SOURCE=https://multiplayer-worldbox.alizer.xyz
